module-help "
CHARMM is a versatile molecular modeling and simulation program designed to
provide broad capabilities for simulating many-particle systems, and includes a
comprehensive set of force fields to simulate biomolecules, such as proteins,
nucleic acids, carbohydrates, lipids, their assemblies, and the small molecules
that interact with these targets.
"

